      "| Turn gate (`hooks/eve-patch-gate.ts`) | `turn.started` | Reads the markers only. Running a turn has already evaluated every carrier, so no path is needed. Refuses on any absence. |\r",
      "\r",
      "The boot probe alone is not enough. A hosted build inlines `eve` and ships no `node_modules/eve`, so\r",
      "the package root does not resolve and the probe reports `unverifiable` rather than refusing —\r",
      "refusing at boot would take down every hosted deploy. The turn gate closes that case: a hosted deploy\r",
